# Firebase Cloud Messaging (Phase 5). Server-side FCM credentials are three
# plain settings values (mykhaya.config: fcm_project_id/fcm_client_email/
# fcm_private_key), never the service-account JSON file itself — but ignore
# the file defensively in case one is ever downloaded into the repo by
# mistake. The Android client-side equivalent (google-services.json) is
# already gitignored separately, in apps/android-shell/android/app/.gitignore.
firebase-service-account*.json
*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json
